{"hw":"νεάω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">νεάω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">νεάω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">νειός</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">plough up,</b> of fallow land, <span class=\"gk\">ἢν νεᾶν βούλησθε.. τοὺς ἀγρούς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1117</span> </span>: metaph., <span class=\"gk\">τὰν μέσαν νεῶν ἄρουραν</span> (in music) Pratin.Lyr.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eup.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">CP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.20.7</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">subj.</span> <span class=\"gk\">νεάσωσι</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.20.8</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">νεωμένη</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">γῆ</span>) <b class=\"lex-tr\">land ploughed up,</b> after lying fallow, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">462</span> </span>.</div></div>"}